SHOPPING LIST:
1. ESP32 NodeMCU-32S | 30 pin
2. 2x SimpleFOC Mini (DRV8313) | needs at least 8 V
3. 2x gimbal motor | 7 pole pairs, ~35 Ω
4. 2x AS5600 | encoders, address 0x36 (can't be changed)
5. MPU-6050 | 0x68
6. 2x MG90S | leg servos
7. 2x VL53L0X | distance sensors, not tested yet on the v2.0
8. 2S LiPo 2600 mAh
9. XL6009 boost | 10 V for the drivers
10. Buck converter | 5 V for the ESP32 and servos
11. 2x 220 µF cap | one on each driver, needed or the ESP32 resets

